WEBVTT

00:03:58.809 --> 00:04:02.110
to a 21st-century problem.

00:04:02.134 --> 00:04:05.627
And the reality is,
what we should be focusing on

00:04:05.651 --> 00:04:08.791
is some of the other root causes
of this problem,

00:04:08.815 --> 00:04:11.672
and many of your speakers today
have talked about that.

00:04:11.696 --> 00:04:17.553
Some of those key root problems
are violence, lack of economic opportunity

00:04:17.577 --> 00:04:19.077
and extreme poverty,

00:04:19.101 --> 00:04:23.609
specifically, in the Northern Triangle:
El Salvador, Guatemala and Honduras.

